          "description": "A themed Halloween weekend at Jellystone Park Austin North running Friday October 9 through Sunday October 11, with a costume contest (pets welcome), a haunted trail and haunted house, a Magic Pumpkin Patch, and park-wide trick-or-treating. Families can also decorate their campsites or golf carts to win a free night of camping. Saturday's schedule includes a costume contest at 3 PM, a golf cart parade, a DJ dance party, and trick-or-treating from 6 to 7 PM. Some activities are free and some require a paid Halloween Fun Pass.",
